application/xml  ->  200 <?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<order id="7"><item>desk</item></order>

application/xml  ->  400 fault: id: missing attribute
application/json  ->  415 fault: unsupported media type: send application/xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<orderList><order id="1"><item>desk</item></order><order id="2"><item>lamp</item></order></orderList>

xml is not a TreeFormat, as intended
